2 CONT She is also mentioned in the testament of her mother in August 14th, 1432 as sister of Inigo Lopez de Mendoza, Elvira de Mendoza and Gonzalo Ruiz de Mendoza. According to her mother's will she chose not to accept her part of her i
2 CONC nheritance. (Perez-Bustamante, Rogelio (1994). [http://elpleitodelosnuevevalles.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/EL-PLEITO-DE-LOS-VALLES-rpb.pdf "Testamento de Leonor de la Vega. El Pleito de los Valles"] (PDF) . pp. 396–400. p.399)
