1 NOTE Patronymics: Moniz, Muniz, Munio, Munoz,
2 CONT
2 CONT I've discovered many of my de Silva ancestors who had married and mixed their blood and genes within the Moniz familia. You will see them all herein.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Moniz family tree has a lot of arguement and controversy surrounding it even in Portugal. One historian says one thing and then another says another. Genealogists add to the controversy as well.
2 CONT Until someone else comes up with data that is verifiable this tree will stand as it is.
2 CONT I've consulted this book:
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT Historia Genealogica de Casa Real Portuguesa,
2 CONT D. Antonio Caetano de Sousa,
2 CONT Atlantida Livaria editora, Lda, 2a Edizao Coimbra, 1946
2 CONT Its the best one thus far.
2 CONT and the source above was verified by these books:
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Manuel João da Costa Felgueiras Gaio, "Nobiliário das Famílias de Portugal", Tomo Vigésimo Primeiro, Título de Monizes, § 17, § 18 e § 19
2 CONT Various Authors, "Armorial Lusitano", p. 370-2, Lisbon, 1961
2 CONT Dom Augusto Romano Sanches de Baena e Farinha de Almeida Portugal Sousa e Silva, 1.º Visconde de Sanches de Baena, "Archivo Heraldico-Genealógico", Volume II, p. CXV, Lisbon, 1872
2 CONT Cristóvão Alão de Morais, "Pedatura Lusitana", Volume I (reformulated edition), p. 668-70
