1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alonso de las Casas Fernandez
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Guillen de las Casas  Mother: Maria Fernandez de Fuentes Marriages
2 CONT
2 CONT Leonor Fernandez Marmolejo 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children •Isabel de Las Casas y Fernandez Hurtado * c. 1430 Pedro Tellez-Giron, mestre da Ordem de Calatrava
2 CONT
2 CONT Biographical Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Data only available to Geneall Plus registered users. Please Login or read access conditions.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geneall.net/H/per_page.php?id=135952
2 CONT
2 CONT ============================
2 CONT Alonso de las Casas Fernandez, mayor of the villague of Priego in 1409. He married Leonor Fernandez Marmolejo (daughter of Diego Hurtado de Mendoza and Leonor Fernandez Marmolejo). They had four sons and a daughter: 
2 CONT * (1) Francisco who was the father of Bartolome de las Casas-the illustrious bishop of Chiapas at the time of the Conquest of Mexico;
