2 CONC disambiguation) . He was Lord of Ayala , Llodio , Arrastaria , Urcabustaiz and Cuartango , major merino of Guipúzcoa in the reign of Pedro I of Castilla , major merino of Castilla in that of Enrique II , and member of the Brotherh
2 CONC ood of Arriaga . [ 2 ] He was also Lord of Torrejón de Velasco , Major advance of Murcia and Major Merino of Asturias .
