1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fontes: BSS-pg. 279 LGFP-pg. 680 LMP-vol. 1-pg. 184 MV-pg. 32 NFP-vol. IV-pg. 301 (Castros) NFP-vol. V-pg. 35 (Eças) PMG-pg. 162
